LeaseWorks

HIGHLIGHTS

o  LeaseWorks program is a new suite of flexible financing options for
   today's technology

o  LeaseWorks TPOptions and LeaseWorks AlphaBridge Option are first two
   products being introduced

SERVICE DESCRIPTIONS

Digital Financial Services' new LeaseWorks offering is an evolving suite of
technology acquisition programs designed to deliver investment protection,
more flexible acquisition and financing strategies, and specific tools to
lower the costs of your systems.

The LeaseWorks program has two initial services: TPOptions and AlphaBridge
Option:

o  The LeaseWorks TPOptions service is a 24- or 36-month leasing program
   that delivers the system power you need today, whether it is an Alpha
   AXP, VAX, or desktop system, with the flexibility to move to a different
   technology whenever you choose.

   The LeaseWorks TPOptions service provides:
   - The flexibility to refresh your technology as computing needs change.
   - Investment protection through equipment credits.
   - A streamlined process to add additional desktops or capacity.
   - Downsizing flexibility.
   - A predetermined technology exit strategy.
   - An operating lease consideration.

o  The LeaseWorks AlphaBridge Option service is a 36-month leasing program
   for users who need a VAX 7000 system now but want to move to the DEC 7000
   AXP system within the next three years. This service lets you acquire VAX
   7000 systems now at DEC 7000 rates. Lease rates are significantly lower
   on DEC 7000 AXP systems because of the higher residual value these
   systems command. With the LeaseWorks AlphaBridge Option service, you can
   upgrade to the DEC 7000 AXP system any time during the term of the lease
   or return the VAX 7000 system at the end of the lease and pay a modest
   return fee equivalent to two monthly payments.

   The LeaseWorks AlphaBridge Option:
   - Lets your business requirements determine when to upgrade to the Alpha
     AXP platform.
   - Allows for smooth technology migration.
   - Maximizes investment in current equipment, technical expertise, and
     software applications.
   - Provides a more economical alternative to a VAX rental.

AVAILABILITY AND ORDERING

The LeaseWorks TPOptions and LeaseWorks AlphaBridge Option services are
available now. Please contact your local Digital sales office or Digital
distributor for ordering information.



