BASEstar Family on AXP, Intel, and VAX Platforms

HIGHLIGHTS

o  New platforms and components for BASEstar family of products, Digital's
   Open Advantage for manufacturing integration

o  BASEstar Open Client for Windows NT V2.0 on Alpha AXP and Intel based
   personal computers

o  BASEstar Open and Siemens Device Access software on OpenVMS AXP systems;
   Device Access software for Allen-Bradley and Modicon plant floor
   equipment on DEC OSF/1 AXP and OpenVMS VAX systems

PRODUCT DESCRIPTION

Digital is meeting manufacturers' integration needs with solutions built on
the BASEstar product family, Digital's manufacturing integration platform
for collecting, managing, and distributing realtime plant floor data and
events. BASEstar products provide core platforms, device interconnect, and
application development enablers supporting the integration of manufacturing
equipment and applications in a plantwide network of heterogeneous
environments. Current product releases include:

o  BASEstar Classic for OpenVMS VAX V3.2
o  BASEstar Open Client for OpenVMS VAX V2.0
o  BASEstar Open Server for OpenVMS VAX V2.0
o  BASEstar Open Client for OSF/1 AXP V2.0
