o  DECosap for OSF/1 AXP V2.0

New releases will introduce support for Windows NT and new industrial
networks such as Allen-Bradley and Modicon:

o  BASEstar Open Client for Windows NT V2.0
o  BASEstar Open Client for OpenVMS AXP V2.0
