Software/documentation	  QB-2XH*B-SA	 QB-2XH*B-SA	   QB-2XH*B-SA
Disk drives		  n x RZ26L-VA	 n x RZ26L-VA	   n x RZ26L-VA
Pedestal enclosure	  1 x BA350-KA	 2 x BA350-KA	   3 x BA350-KA
Cables    		  BN21H-02	 CK-SWXCR-AA	   CK-SWXCR-AA
