Additional StorageWorks components, such as BA35X-xx redundant power
supplies, can be ordered as options. Note that the number of disk drives is
reduced by one per BA350-KA enclosure when redundant power supplies are
used.

AVAILABILITY AND ORDERING

The StorageWorks RAID Array 210 Subsystem is available now. Please keep in
