o  Rackmountable VAX 4000 Model 105A systems not only offer the same
   functionality as Model 105A desktop versions -- including a 12 ns NVAX
   chip, 150 TPS, and 32 VUPs -- but you gain 33 percent more performance
   than either rackmount or desktop Model 100A systems at a lower price.

o  You can request factory integrated rackmountable Model 105A systems or
   you can field install a rackmountable system in an existing, industry
   standard 19-inch-wide rack, freeing valuable floor space. Rackmounting
   allows for system growth in a smaller footprint and consolidates and
   organizes computer accessories and cabling.

o  Rackmountable ADVANTAGE-UPGRADES help you protect your investment in
   currently installed systems by providing Q-bus connectivity to use the
   current systems as Q-bus expansions. You can also trade in your current
   systems for credit that is already built into the U.S. list price.

