 DIGITAL'S INTEGRATED LIBRARY SOLUTIONS.....In more than 2,000 academic,
 public, national, and specialty libraries around the world, Digital is
 the technology of choice for networked, client-server, integrated auto-
 mation projects. Alpha AXP's 64-bit technology provides libraries with
 unprecedented investment protection. The storage capacity, access
 speed, and long-term growth features of Alpha AXP provide the ability
 to easily and quickly store, search, and retrieve large amounts of
 data. Alpha's 64-bit addressing capability means library applications
 can be developed more quickly since programmers no longer have to worry
 about program segmentation or overlays. It also gives the library the
 power to move into more sophisticated imaging and multimedia technolo-
 gies. 64-Bit data allows database applications to perform large data
 sorts at previously unheard of speeds. In addition, Alpha AXP RISC
 based servers, workstations, and PCs deliver the industry's best price
 performance in every price category.

