 next version of the key parallel computing software package, PVM, is
 being developed on an Alpha AXP. A joint collaboration between the
 University of Tennessee and the Oak Ridge National Laboratory includes
 a team of six members working on the development of PVM code on several
 Alpha AXP workstations. Jack Dongarra, a distinguished scientist at the
