 As you can see, already many experts from all over the world are
 committing themselves to this new and interesting event. It is now of
 utmost importance to making this event a successful one, by the
 particiption of all HPCN experts, and to establish a regular European
 HPCN Forum.

 TO ACHIEVE THIS WE KINDLY ASK YOU FOR YOUR HELP:

 Would you please be so kind and to distribute this information
 (including this letter) to as many colleagues as possible, in your
 institution as well as outside all over the world. And please encourage
 them to do the same.

 Let's combine all our efforts to bringing the whole HPCN Family
 together in Munich!

 I wish to thank you cordially!

 Wolfgang Gentzsch
