DECimage V3.0

HIGHLIGHTS

o  Provides platform for rapid development of customizable document
   management solutions

o  Offers APIs to add document images to existing environments; provides
   image editor with highlighting and annotation capabilities

o  Adds supports for DEC OSF/1 AXP servers

PRODUCT DESCRIPTION

DECimage V3.0 is a client/server platform for customizable document
management applications. It provides an editor to manipulate documents
consisting of scanned image pages, ASCII text, and associated annotation
texts. It offers APIs for the storage and printing of such documents and
allows applications to be built with, for example, Microsoft Visual Basic or
GUPTA SQL Windows.

Document management systems made with DECimage V3.0 can also handle other
documents types, provided the corresponding editor is integrated into the
solution.

The scalability of DECimage V3.0 allows effective systems ranging from a few
to hundreds of seats, and support from thousands to millions of documents.
DECimage V3.0 makes use of industry standard interfaces, so systems
integrators can combine DECimage V3.0 with third party components for
special functions (FAX, OCR, FTR).

BENEFITS

o  Documents can include ASCII text, image pages, annotations, and
   associated texts (including spreadsheets and word processing documents),
   providing you with a wide range of flexibility in storing information.

o  Icon annotations and highlighting on image pages provide a powerful tool
   for day-to-day business processing.

o  DECimage V3.0 integrates easily into your existing environment and adds
   document images to your systems.

o  DECimage V3.0 operates on MS-Windows based PC clients, in combination
   with DEC OSF/1 AXP servers or SCO UNIX based servers with DECadvantage
   products. Thus you can implement a robust document management solution on
   standard platforms.

o  DECimage V3.0 offers a variety of optical disk storage devices that can
   be added easily to a configuration, growing your storage capacity as
   needed.

COMPARISON WITH DECimage EXpress

DECimage V3.0 complements Digital's Document Image Management product family
and will coexist with DECimage EXpress software to provide solutions for
document image management. DECimage V3.0 is the product to choose when you
need a customized solution for an environment based on UNIX and Microsoft's
Windows.

DECimage EXpress is the product to choose when you are operating in an
OpenVMS VAX and DECnet environment or require a choice of workstation, X
terminal, or PC desktops.

AVAILABILITY AND ORDERING

Worldwide shipments of DECimage V3.0 will begin in June 1994.

