POLYCENTER PERFORMANCE SOLUTION V2.1 FOR OpenVMS

POLYCENTER Performance Solution is a set of layered products that collect
system data and then use that data to provide performance and capacity
management. These products are POLYCENTER Performance Data Collector (SPD
36.02), POLYCENTER Performance Advisor (SPD 36.03), and POLYCENTER
Accounting Chargeback (SPD 36.60).

The Performance Solution significantly reduces the time and effort required
to optimize current and future configurations and to right-size system
resources at the right time and for the right cost. The Accounting
Chargeback product provides you with reports that track system usage for
internal decision making and billing.

The new features in the V2.1 release are:

o  Compliance with OpenVMS V6.1 on the VAX and AXP platforms.
o  Performance Advisor support of Phase IV and Phase V (ADVANTAGE-NETWORKS)
   both with and without the use of node synonyms.
o  New device support.
o  Improved reporting and graphing.
o  A graphical user interface for Accounting Chargeback and the availability
   of this product on OpenVMS AXP systems.
o  Realtime displays supporting a playback mode.
o  Selective analysis through the use of device and process filters.
o  Graph, pie chart, and export data available in CSV (comma separated
   variable) format.

POLYCENTER Data Collector V2.0 and POLYCENTER Performance Advisor V2.0 are
currently shipping on both OpenVMS VAX and OpenVMS AXP systems; the V2.1
releases of these products on both platforms will ship this spring.

POLYCENTER Accounting Chargeback V1.1 is currently shipping on OpenVMS VAX
systems. The V2.1 release will be available in late spring on the OpenVMS
VAX and AXP platforms and can be ordered immediately. This product is
offered with a Traditional flat capacity license. It will be included on the
Consolidated Distribution CDROM for DEC OSF/1 and the documentation will be
on the Online Documentation CDROM.

