TUXEDO SOFTWARE V2.1 FOR DEC OSF/1 AXP SYSTEMS

TUXEDO Software for DEC OSF/1 AXP systems (SPD 48.04) is the first complete
client/server OLTP environment available on Digital's DEC OSF/1 AXP
platform. It provides applications designers and programmers with the
flexibilty and efficiency of a state-of-the-art framework for building UNIX
OLTP applications.

The major components of Digital's TUXEDO product are:

o  The TUXEDO/T OLTP monitor, which provides complete monitor features
   including prioritization, scheduling, buffer management, function
   shipping, and load balancing.

o  The /WS option, which provides complete client support for the most
   popular desktops and Digital workstations.

o  The /Q facility, which allows for the batch processing of transactions.

New features available with the V2.1 release:

o  Support for two new /WS clients: Windows NT (Intel based) and Macintosh
   desktops. This adds to the existing client support for MS-DOS, Windows,
   ULTRIX, and DEC OSF/1 systems announced with the release of TUXEDO
   Software V2.0.

o  Up to 14 different network protocols are now supported by the new virtual
   sockets feature, including 3Com, PATHWORKS, HP ARPA, Locus TCP/IP,
   Microsoft LAN Manager TCP/IP, Novell LAN WorkPlace for DOS, Windows
   Sockets, and Wollongong networks.

o  The /Q feature is shipped with the /T server software at no additional
   cost. /Q makes it possible for an application, within a global
   transaction, to enqueue a message to stable storage for later processing.

TUXEDO Software V2.1 for DEC OSF/1 AXP systems provides an OLTP solution
that is much less costly and complex to develop, manage, and maintain. The
use of standards based TUXEDO allows a high degree of portability and
interoperability across more than 25 platforms available from multiple
vendors today. Other major benefits include:

o  Higher application availability and performance.
o  Integration of hetergeneous database management systems.
o  Protection of existing and future technology investments.

TUXEDO Software V2.1 for DEC OSF/1 AXP systems will be available in June
1994.

