PRODUCT DESCRIPTION

Digital has teamed with Platform Computing Corporation, Inc., to offer Load
Sharing Facility (LSF) V1.2 throughput enhancing software for multivendor,
heterogeneous UNIX workstation clusters. LSF gives you transparent access to
the full compute power of systems on a network. Interactive and batch jobs
are automatically sent to the least loaded or most appropriate system in the
cluster.

LSF V1.2 supports DEC OSF/1 AXP and ULTRIX RISC systems, along with IBM AIX
on RS/6000s, HP-UX on HP9000s, SunOS and Solaris on SPARCstations, and IRIX
on Silicon Graphics systems.

BENEFITS

With LSM V1.2, your end users will see reduced job completion times and your
system managers will observe that more jobs are completed faster. Each user
in the system will have access to all systems on the network. In addition,
DECservice support will be available to ease the installation and servicing
of LSF in heterogeneous system environments.

AVAILABILITY AND ORDERING

LSF V1.2 is offered under the terms and conditions of Platform Computing
Corporation. It is shipping now. A 30 day software loan is available.

Digital services for LSF can be purchased across all platforms. Digital
installation services are now available and strongly recommended.

